          "text": "baamba kuti, Tantamuka okuno, utasweni afwiifwi kulindime, nkaambo tulaandeene ayebo. Bantu bali obo bandikataazya mbuli busi mumpemu, mbuli mulilo uuyaka buzuba boonse. ",
