        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova. Mbubonya mbuli musinza uulwela mbuujanwa mucikungo camisaansa, elyo muntu ulaamba kuti, Utacinyonyooni, nkaambo muli coolwe mulincico, nzoocita mbubonya obo kubalanda bangu. Nsikooyoobanyonyoona boonse pe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
