        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Balanda bangu bayoolya, pele inywe muyoofwa inzala. Balanda bangu bayoonywa, pele inywe muyoofwa nyota, Balanda bangu bayoosekelela, pele inywe muyoousa insoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
