        },
        {
          "text": "Pele amukondwe akusekelela lyoonse nkaambo kaceeci ncinsi lenge, nkaambo ndalenga Jerusalemu, ube cikondelezyo, abantu bawo, babe cibotezyo. ",
          "type": "text",
