        },
        {
          "text": "Tamukooyooba limbi mulinguwo mucece uufwa natana kukula, nanka mucembele uufwamba kufwa niitana kuzulila myaka yakwe. Mwana uyoofwa naamana myaka iili mwanda. Pele sizibi uuli amyaka iili mwanda uyooba mutusi.",
          "type": "text",
