        {
          "text": "Maanda ngebayaka taakooyookalwa umbi, amicelo njibabyala tiikooyooligwa umbi pe, nkaambo mazuba aabantu bangu ayooba mbuli mazuba aamusamu, abantu mbensalide bayoongozya milimo yamaanza aabo. ",
